  <CBF_Pw_Swap>替換</CBF_Pw_Swap>
  <!-- EN: Replaces the piece with another one that fits the same layers. Material, quality and color stay where possible. -->
  <CBF_Pw_SwapTip>用另一件適配相同層位的部件替換。材質、品質與顏色儘可能保留。</CBF_Pw_SwapTip>
  <!-- EN: Swap piece -->
  <CBF_Pw_SwapPick>替換部件</CBF_Pw_SwapPick>
  <!-- EN: Add {0} -->
  <CBF_Pw_AddChosen>新增 {0}</CBF_Pw_AddChosen>
  <!-- EN: Tech level -->
  <CBF_Pw_Stage>科技等級</CBF_Pw_Stage>
  <!-- EN: from gear -->
  <CBF_Pw_StageAuto>由裝備決定</CBF_Pw_StageAuto>
  <!-- EN: The tech level this list counts as. "from gear" works it out from the weapons and apparel of each pawn kind. Set a level when the gear does not fit, for example tribal warriors with medieval leather who should appear in a tribal camp. The settlement then draws from the whole list without looking at the gear. The log warns when the level is above that of the settlement. -->
  <CBF_Pw_StageTip>該清單計為的科技等級。"由裝備決定"會根據每個人物種類的武器與服裝推算。當裝備不符時可設定一個等級，例如穿著中世紀皮革的部落戰士應出現在部落營地中。此後據點會直接從整個清單中抽取，不再檢視裝備。當日誌顯示等級高於據點時會發出警告。</CBF_Pw_StageTip>
  <!-- EN: Ideoligion role -->
  <CBF_Pw_IdeoRole>意識形態角色</CBF_Pw_IdeoRole>
  <!-- EN: none -->
  <CBF_Pw_IdeoRoleNone>無</CBF_Pw_IdeoRoleNone>
  <!-- EN: Combat role by weapon -->
  <CBF_Pw_IdeoRoleFight>按武器定的戰鬥角色</CBF_Pw_IdeoRoleFight>
  <!-- EN: With Ideology, pawns of this kind get this role of their faction's ideoligion. Combat role by weapon gives the shooting or melee specialist depending on the weapon. -->
  <CBF_Pw_IdeoRoleTip>啟用意識形態時，這類角色會獲得其派系意識形態中的該角色。按武器定的戰鬥角色會根據武器指定射擊或近戰專家。</CBF_Pw_IdeoRoleTip>
